{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Client for performing WebAuthn passkey operations."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Client","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/GettingStarted"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Provides a unified interface for passkey registration and authentication"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"backed by a YubiKey via CTAP2 protocol (USB\/NFC)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PIN entry and UV decisions are supplied per ceremony via the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter on "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client\/makeCredential(_:authorization:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client\/getAssertion(_:authorization:)"},{"type":"text","text":". The status stream reports ceremony"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"progress ("},{"code":".processing","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":".waitingForUser","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".waitingForUserVerification","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":".finished","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") only.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let session = try await CTAP2.Session.makeSession(connection: connection)","let client = WebAuthn.Client(","    session: session,","    origin: try .init(\"https:\/\/example.com\"),","    isPublicSuffix: { publicSuffixList.contains($0) }",")","","\/\/ Trivial — pre-supplied PIN:","let response = try await client.makeCredential(options, authorization: .pin(\"1234\")).value","","\/\/ Custom — bridge into a UI:","let auth = WebAuthn.Authorization(providePIN: {","    guard let pin = await viewModel.askForPIN() else { return .cancel }","    return .pin(pin)","})","for try await status in await client.makeCredential(options, authorization: auth) {","    switch status {","    case .processing: showSpinner()","    case .waitingForUser(let cancel):","        showTouchPrompt(onCancel: { Task { await cancel() } })","    case .waitingForUserVerification(let cancel, let fallbackToPIN):","        showBiometricPrompt(","            onCancel: { Task { await cancel() } },","            onFallbackToPIN: fallbackToPIN.map { fallback in { Task { await fallback() } } }","        )","    case .finished(let response): return response","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PIN attempts are one-shot: a wrong PIN throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/ClientError\/pinRejected(retriesRemaining:source:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and the caller"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"decides whether to re-prompt and retry with a fresh "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Returning "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization\/PINReply\/cancel"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"code":"providePIN","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" aborts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the ceremony with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/ClientError\/cancelled(source:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" is a high-level passkey client that runs WebAuthn ceremonies against a YubiKey."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Client","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the entry point for WebAuthn in this SDK. It wraps a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and translates W3C WebAuthn requests into CTAP2 protocol exchanges — building the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"clientDataJSON","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", validating the relying-party identifier against the configured","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","type":"reference"},{"text":", selecting between PIN and built-in user verification, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"processing extensions before the request reaches the authenticator.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"code":"Client","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for any app that runs passkey ceremonies. Reach for ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directly only when you need lower-level access — raw ","type":"text"},{"code":"makeCredential","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"getAssertion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", credential management, or bio enrollment.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" is an actor; a client’s lifetime is bound to the underlying "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The constructor takes four parameters that shape every ceremony:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origin"},{"type":"text","text":" — the secure origin the client is bound to. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enforces"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the W3C secure-context rule; the client refuses to sign for relying parties whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier doesn’t match."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPublicSuffix"},{"type":"text","text":" — a closure into a Public Suffix List, used to validate that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the relying-party identifier is a registrable suffix of the origin’s effective"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"domain."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enterpriseRpIds"},{"type":"text","text":" — relying-party identifiers allowed to receive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform-managed enterprise attestation. When the request specifies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/AttestationPreference\/enterprise"},{"type":"text","text":", the client escalates to level 2"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(platform-managed) for RPs in this set, and uses level 1 (vendor-facilitated)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"allowedExtensions"},{"type":"text","text":" — the set of WebAuthn extensions the client will process."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Anything the relying party requests outside this set is dropped before reaching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the authenticator. Defaults to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"’s standard set."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"PIN and user verification are supplied per ceremony via ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out-of-band from the ceremony stream. Both ceremony methods return a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/StatusStream"},{"text":" — drain it with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"value()"},{"text":" for non-UI callers, or iterate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to drive cancel buttons and biometric prompts.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["let client = WebAuthn.Client(","    session: session,","    origin: try .init(\"https:\/\/example.com\"),","    isPublicSuffix: { publicSuffixList.contains($0) }",")","","for try await status in await client.makeCredential(opts, authorization: .pin(\"1234\")) {","    switch status {","    case .processing:","        showSpinner()","    case .waitingForUser(let cancel):","        showTouchPrompt(onCancel: { Task { await cancel() } })","    case .waitingForUserVerification(let cancel, _):","        showBiometricPrompt(onCancel: { Task { await cancel() } })","    case .finished(let response):","        return response","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clientData:"},{"type":"text","text":" overloads accept a pre-built "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/ClientData","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instead of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"building one from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origin"},{"type":"text","text":" + challenge. Use them in iOS Credential Provider \/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"AutoFill flows, where the system supplies a precomputed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clientDataHash"},{"type":"text","text":" rather"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than the full "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clientDataJSON"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn"],"title":"WebAuthn Client","anchor":"WebAuthn-Client"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client\/init(session:origin:enterpriseRpIds:allowedExtensions:isPublicSuffix:)"],"title":"Creating a Client","anchor":"Creating-a-Client"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client\/makeCredential(_:authorization:)","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client\/makeCredential(_:clientData:authorization:)"],"title":"Registra